cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KHEPRI-DC-FB, please cite it as below."
title: "KHEPRI-DC-FB v1.0: Data-centre queues against flow-based import limits in the Norwegian bidding zones: a preregistered descriptive analysis"
abstract: >-
  Preregistered descriptive analysis of how many market time units the
  data-centre queue in each Norwegian bidding zone, added as load, would
  require more import than the published flow-based minimum net position
  allows, 2024-10-30 to 2026-10-31. Realised net position from JAO
  fbDomainShadowPrice, minimum net position from JAO maxNetPos (source:
  JAO Nordic Publication Tool). No JAO raw data or time series are included.
type: software
